OL,3,GNEWSARestored historic buildings make
OL,4,AScottish architecture shortlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree projects to reuse and restore
OL,7,Fhistoric buildings are in the running
OL,8,Ffor the award for best building in
OL,9,FScotland.
OL,11,FThe outdoor swimming pool pavilion in
OL,12,FMacduff, Aberdeenshire, Paisley's
OL,13,Fcentral library in Renfrewshire and
OL,14,FEdinburgh Futures Institute made the
OL,15,Fshortlist in the Andrew Doolan Best
OL,16,FBuilding in Scotland Award.
OL,18,FRun by The Royal Incorporation of
OL,19,FArchitects in Scotland (RIAS), it is
OL,20,Fthe country's foremost architecture
OL,21,Faccolade.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
